<view class="page {{deviceClass}} coach-page">
  <stemist-header eyebrow="STEM STUDIO · AI COACH" title="检查这道题" subtitle="Question evidence → diagnosis → next action" action-text="重拍" bind:action="retake" />
  <view class="route-pill">{{contextLabel}}</view>
  <view class="workspace-grid">
    <view class="context-card evidence-card">
      <view class="context-card-title">当前证据</view>
      <image wx:if="{{imagePath}}" class="photo-preview" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit" />
      <view wx:else class="empty-evidence">照片未找到，请返回重新拍摄。</view>
      <view class="context-card-text">AI Coach 只会基于这张照片和你的补充说明分析；路线标签用于聚焦，不是正式成绩或权限依据。</view>
    </view>
    <coach-panel message="{{message}}" answer="{{answer}}" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{!imagePath}}" submit-label="提交给 AI Coach" placeholder="例如：请指出我第一步哪里错了，并告诉我下一步怎么做。" helper="建议先提交原始证据，再根据 Coach 的诊断进行一次 focused retest。" bind:input="onMessage" bind:submit="ask" />
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="notice">STEM Studio 的正式分数仍以有来源、可追溯的评分结果为准；照片 Coach 是学习反馈，不会伪造官方成绩。</view>
</view>
